# Apex Rush — project rules for Cline

Read `AGENTS.md` in the repo root first, then the docs it points to (`docs/architecture.md`,
`docs/conventions.md`, `docs/workflow.md`, `docs/backlog.md`, `docs/session-log.md`).

Non-negotiables:

- Never edit `.godot/` — it is a generated, git-ignored cache.
- Run `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/check_references.ps1` after ANY file move, rename or
  delete. It must print `OK - all references resolve`.
- Moving/renaming an asset means: move it with its `.import`/`.uid` sidecar, preserve its original UID, and
  update every `res://` reference in `.tscn` / `.gd` / `.import`.
- `snake_case` for all folders and files; a scene and its script are colocated and share a name.
- Put new files where `docs/architecture.md` says — never in the project root.
- `GameManager` is the only autoload.
- Verify with the four checks in `docs/workflow.md` before declaring work complete.
- Commit per logical change; update `docs/architecture.md` on structure changes and append to
  `docs/session-log.md` at the end of a session.
